Comment: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:43.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:48.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:51.92,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:58.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:04.34,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:12.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}最喜歡你了
